  m_text: "MISSION OBJECTIVE\r\n\r\nComplete the Sudoku grid before the bomb timer
    reaches zero.\r\n\r\nCONTROLS\r\n\r\n\u2022 Click a cell to select it.\r\n\u2022
    Press 1\u20139 or use the number buttons to enter a number.\r\n\u2022 Use Arrow
    Keys to move between cells.\r\n\u2022 Press Space to preview numbers.\r\n\r\nMISSION
    RULES\r\n\r\n\u2022 Correct answer gives +2 seconds.\r\n\u2022 Completing a row,
    column, or box gives +10 seconds.\r\n\u2022 Wrong answer removes 10 seconds and
    adds a strike.\r\n\u2022 Use hints carefully."
